        {
          "text": "Describes plans for a global smallpox vaccine reserve reviewed by WHO's Ad Hoc Committee on Orthopoxvirus Infections, including pledged and physical stockpiles and a target number of doses. It adds that WHO is finalizing an operational framework covering vaccine specifications, procurement, storage, liability and release procedures.",
